@startuml
|Director / Admin|
start
:Create sponsor account;
|Secretary|
:Enter first contribution;
if (Specific student?) then (Yes)
  :Assign to student;
else (No)
  :Leave as general donor;
endif
:Log contribution;
:Send "your account is ready" invitation;

|Sponsor|
:Click link;
if (Link expired?) then (Yes)
  :Contact office for new link;
  stop
else (No)
  :Set password / claim account;
  :Tick Agreement;
endif

|System|
:Link user to existing sponsor;
:Trigger welcome;
stop
@enduml
